#!args --check
# physicstest is a console program: every test group of lib/physics against its references (math, hull,
# ray, distance, cast, tunnel, seams, bvh, world, fuzz, edge), of the character controller (character,
# charfuzz) and of the rigid bodies (mass, motion, contact, stack, joint, ccd, events, dynfuzz); exit code 1
# when a check fails.  The determinism checksums (--checksum) are compared across the targets by hand
# (docs/PHYSICS.md, "Prüfsummen" and "Prüfsumme der Starrkörper").
